  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">빵<ruby style=\"position: relative\">춘<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">헝<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QjyGy5LdWB4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UBirevB-fPg?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>原版 Original ver.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">獨夜<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">덕야ˉ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">伴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">퐐ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">守<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쥬ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">燈下<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뎽ˉ에ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">清風<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">對面<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뒤`삔ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">吹<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">체ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.65em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tork-yā bo-phoā̰ jiû-tiēng-ē, chiēng-hông tùi-bīn chê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">十<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">잡-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">七<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">八<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뵣</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">未<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뻬-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出嫁<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춛ˆ게</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">見<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">길`-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">少年家<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄉᆤ`롄게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jap-chît-poeh be-chût-ke, kḭ̀-tioh-siàu-lien-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">果然<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">고ˆ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">漂緻<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄇᆤˉ디</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">面肉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삔빻</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">白<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">벻ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">誰<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">게ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人子弟<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">랑즈ˆ데ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kô-rien-piāu-ti bin-bah pêh, sui-kê lang-ĵ-tē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뾯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">驚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歹勢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">패ˆ세</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心內<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">彈<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">돨-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">琵琶<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">비베ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-boêh-mng-ī kiā̰-phâi-se, sīm-lāi toa̰-pi-pé\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뾯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">良君<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">령군ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">조`-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">翁婿<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">앙ˉ새</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">意愛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이`애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">在<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">재-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心內<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-boêh-liong-kûn jò-āng-sai, ì-ai jai-sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">待<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">태-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">何時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">호시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">君<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">군ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">採<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">채`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">青春<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">當開<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">등ˉ캐ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thai-ho-sí kûn lai-chài, chiēng-chûn huê tn̄g-khâi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.95em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">忽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">훋ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">外口<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽈ᄏᅷ`</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">랑-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">래ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開門<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">퀴ˉ믕ˊ</rt></ruby> 가<ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看覓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">콸`매ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.61em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hût-thiā̰-goa-khàu u-lang-lái, khūi-mńg ka̰-ī khoà̰-māi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">月老<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽏로`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쵸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 껑<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">大<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">돠-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">呆<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">대ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> 허<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">騙<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">폔</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">재ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.65em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goat-lò chiò-gùn gong-toa-tâi, hor-hōng-phien m-jâi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>鳳飛飛版 Fong Fei-fei ver.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family: